&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şimdi bu c&amp;uuml;mlelerin toplamında, evet bir &amp;ouml;zeleştiri var, ancak &amp;ouml;zne hep dağınık, sorumluluk dağınık, sonu&amp;ccedil;lar somut, fakat sorumlular &amp;ccedil;oğu zaman &amp;ldquo;dışarıda.&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

